    "detailed_description": "Every Year Banjir is survival game based on a fictionalized Malaysian society depicted as Malaysian animals with the aim to storify and gamify real world issues. <br>Survive all the harsh conditions in the Tsunami of Timber, the Flooding House, and on the Rooftop of an Apartment building. <br><br>This is a world in the near future where serious floods happen more frequently and disastrously till a point where the waters reach to the height of high rise buildings. Although being a fictional world, the game reflects realistic issues faced by Malaysian flood victims.<br><br>You can play as three different characters, each character defines the difficulty of the game. EZ Harimau is the casual run-through experience, Gajah Jr. is the moderate difficulty about kinship and Hardcore Ayam packs a bigger challenge to care for children during a disaster.<br><br>Survive the harsh conditions of the random rainfalls and equip yourself with flood survival skills and knowledge. Your knowledge will enable you to make decisions that will give you an edge in dire situations. By raising your Flood Awareness Level, you will be able to create new tools and methods to survive against all odds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/b6c738ef8adf83204c258e702a339b71.poster.avif?t=1687239396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/b6c738ef8adf83204c258e702a339b71.webm?t=1687239396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/b6c738ef8adf83204c258e702a339b71.mp4?t=1687239396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/50087652140cda65d047b9285332d3e2.poster.avif?t=1687239396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/50087652140cda65d047b9285332d3e2.webm?t=1687239396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/50087652140cda65d047b9285332d3e2.mp4?t=1687239396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The demo of the game consist only of the first Shelter stage. This is the stage that you will be able to interact with other NPCs, gain XP, learn survival skills and find survival tools.",
