7652140cda65d047b9285332d3e2.poster.avif?t=1687239396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/50087652140cda65d047b9285332d3e2.webm?t=1687239396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2471380/extras/50087652140cda65d047b9285332d3e2.mp4?t=1687239396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The demo of the game consist only of the first Shelter stage. This is the stage that you will be able to interact with other NPCs, gain XP, learn survival skills and find survival tools.",
